        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14735\">PR #14735</a> from <code>alexcrichton:fix-oveflow</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The function <code>drain_drop_stack</code> could recursively call itself for each<br>\ndepth in a guest controlled type, even though its purpose was to make<br>\nsuch a process iterative.</p>\n<p>This PR removes the recursive calls and also adds a debug check that it<br>\n<code>drain_drop_stack</code> is not being recursively called.</p>\n<p>part of <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-wjc8-633q-pwxr\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-wjc8-633q-pwxr</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
